{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"杏林在線｜PDRN真有其效？\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/APP-ONLINE-I-PDRN-261116.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】PDRN是近年熱門的護膚成分，聲稱可以促進細胞修復，回復皮膚緊緻。不同形態的PDRN，究竟是否真的有效？今集《杏林在線》請來，香港城巿大學化學系教授黃駿弦跟我們講解。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T13:53:28.988546+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":91,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T13:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T14:12:31.164419+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T13:47:02.709362+00:00","content_hash":"fa1f71e25a1bb6fa4f724c7272d7f82e7ec7d81ec216da3d4a91fb2558574121","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}